WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 11=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:41.870 --> 01:42.840
If I

01:43.710 --> 01:45.200
delay Xiuwan's marriage,

01:46.310 --> 01:49.430
Mother and I
will both feel terrible about it.

01:57.840 --> 02:01.510
Invite the Xie family to see
the flowers on the Festival of Man.

02:05.928 --> 02:08.216
The plum blossoms in the courtyard
have already withered.

02:08.392 --> 02:09.752
Why not admire paintings instead?

02:10.680 --> 02:12.520
Don't get any ideas about my paintings.

02:14.430 --> 02:16.870
It wouldn't be proper
to invite only the Xie family.

02:17.560 --> 02:19.710
You and Jinqiao
can send out invitations together.

02:20.000 --> 02:21.590
Invite all the young men

02:21.590 --> 02:24.710
around your age
who share your interests.

02:24.840 --> 02:26.190
Let's make it a lively gathering.

02:27.910 --> 02:30.400
Mother plans to find matches
this year for Cuique and Xiuru.

02:31.030 --> 02:33.240
She must be happy.

02:35.590 --> 02:36.400
Oh, right.

02:37.630 --> 02:39.710
Don't forget the invitation
for the Zhao family.

02:39.710 --> 02:41.240
Whether they come is up to them.

02:41.400 --> 02:44.080
But we must observe proper etiquette.

02:47.980 --> 02:50.180
(Festival of Man)
Is this straight now?

02:50.190 --> 02:51.720
Raise the left side a little higher.

02:52.240 --> 02:52.800
Good.

02:53.150 --> 02:53.840
How about now?

02:54.030 --> 02:55.520
A little to the right. A little more.

02:55.800 --> 02:56.190
Slowly.

02:56.408 --> 02:57.750
Clean everything more thoroughly.

02:57.848 --> 02:58.968
Make sure it's spotless.

02:59.240 --> 03:01.080
Careful. Put it here. Right here.

03:01.090 --> 03:03.390
- First Madam. Second Madam.
- First Madam. Second Madam.

03:03.400 --> 03:05.110
- First Madam. Second Madam.
- First Madam. Second Madam.

03:05.120 --> 03:07.180
Come help once you've
finished wiping the doorframe.

03:07.190 --> 03:07.840
Yes.

03:12.960 --> 03:13.710
That's about right.

03:16.808 --> 03:18.840
You certainly know
how to handle things, Shunhua.

03:19.120 --> 03:21.470
Otherwise, Old Master
would never have agreed.

03:24.560 --> 03:25.360
Just think about it.

03:25.370 --> 03:27.680
Young Lady Zhao was the one
who did something disgraceful,

03:27.680 --> 03:29.832
yet we're the ones
who have to swallow our anger.

03:30.560 --> 03:33.470
Old Madam and Jinlan
still don't know about it.

03:33.800 --> 03:35.160
If you keep talking like this,

03:35.630 --> 03:37.710
I won't dare confide in you again.

03:37.840 --> 03:39.030
I was wrong.

03:39.310 --> 03:41.120
I promise I won't mention it again.

03:43.150 --> 03:46.310
Don't spend all day
watching your future son-in-law.

03:46.520 --> 03:48.280
You might scare him away.

03:48.910 --> 03:51.360
We still have Cuique and Xiuru.

03:51.592 --> 03:53.512
Help me see
if anyone is suitable for them.

03:53.520 --> 03:54.870
Don't worry, Shunhua.

03:56.360 --> 03:56.910
First Madam.

03:56.910 --> 03:57.800
Second Madam.

04:01.400 --> 04:03.150
There will be many male guests today.

04:03.560 --> 04:05.710
Make sure every door
that should be locked is locked.

04:05.720 --> 04:06.780
At every entrance and exit,

04:06.790 --> 04:08.570
station some stern servants
to keep watch.

04:08.584 --> 04:11.120
Keep careful track of everyone
who comes and goes.

04:11.960 --> 04:13.560
If anyone who shouldn't enter gets in,

04:13.960 --> 04:15.470
or anyone who shouldn't leave gets out,

04:16.120 --> 04:17.390
I'll hold you responsible.

04:18.800 --> 04:19.630
- Yes.
- Yes.

04:21.830 --> 04:22.950
I have two sons,

04:23.360 --> 04:24.800
but only one daughter.

04:25.270 --> 04:27.430
Normally, when you make a mistake,

04:27.600 --> 04:29.310
I turn a blind eye.

04:29.680 --> 04:31.270
But if anything goes wrong today

04:31.390 --> 04:32.750
and Xiuwan becomes a laughingstock,

04:32.872 --> 04:34.690
there'll be no need
for Shunhua to punish you.

04:34.720 --> 04:35.870
Every last one of you

04:36.040 --> 04:37.040
will answer to me.

04:37.480 --> 04:38.160
Second Madam,

04:38.160 --> 04:39.310
First Madam, don't worry.

04:39.480 --> 04:41.310
We'll keep a close watch today.

04:41.430 --> 04:42.000
Forget people.

04:42.120 --> 04:43.190
Even if a fly gets in,

04:43.190 --> 04:45.000
it won't escape our notice.

04:45.120 --> 04:45.800
Good.

04:47.390 --> 04:48.070
You may go.

04:54.870 --> 04:55.950
I've been so focused on

04:56.040 --> 04:57.600
how to entertain the Xie family today

04:58.000 --> 04:59.800
that I overlooked these details.

05:00.750 --> 05:04.240
A great wind begins
with the faintest breeze.

05:04.568 --> 05:06.600
A dike can collapse
from the smallest ant hole.

05:07.600 --> 05:10.600
All the young men and women
here today are unmarried.

05:11.360 --> 05:12.480
A handkerchief

05:12.870 --> 05:13.870
or a sachet

05:14.160 --> 05:16.360
could easily become fodder for gossip.

05:17.656 --> 05:20.070
Once a man and woman
are rumored to be secretly involved,

05:20.216 --> 05:22.160
no amount of explaining
can clear their names.

05:23.112 --> 05:25.240
Then an unintended match
could be forced upon them.

05:25.560 --> 05:26.800
They'd have to marry whether

05:27.480 --> 05:28.800
they wanted to or not.

05:29.000 --> 05:31.040
And people would say the Lin family

05:31.040 --> 05:32.360
has no proper standards.

05:33.070 --> 05:33.870
Yes.

05:34.040 --> 05:34.630
That's right.

05:35.920 --> 05:38.680
We really can't afford
to be careless today.

05:38.950 --> 05:40.920
- Good.
- Good.

05:41.220 --> 05:41.910
This way, please.

05:42.168 --> 05:43.120
- Here.
- Fill it up.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.010
Please.

05:45.630 --> 05:47.750
- Good.
- Good.

05:49.160 --> 05:50.310
One point for the blue team.

05:57.000 --> 05:58.430
- Good.
- Good.

05:58.430 --> 05:59.800
One point for the red team.

06:02.280 --> 06:04.510
It's not often we can get
everyone together like this.

06:08.360 --> 06:09.190
Really?

06:10.240 --> 06:11.390
Wonderful.

06:12.870 --> 06:14.310
You certainly have a way with words.

06:20.830 --> 06:22.360
Young Ladies, please have some tea.

06:34.312 --> 06:35.560
Look at this embroidery pattern.

06:40.008 --> 06:41.310
The calligraphy is quite good.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.720
I can copy it when I get home.

06:43.890 --> 06:44.950
Here, give it a try.

06:45.160 --> 06:45.660
All right.

07:05.040 --> 07:06.600
- Good.
- Good.

07:17.160 --> 07:19.270
I heard the Zhao family

07:19.600 --> 07:21.680
is arranging
another match for Zhao Xingtang.

07:22.800 --> 07:24.660
(Niu Fan)
His family background and status

07:24.680 --> 07:26.160
are no less distinguished than yours.

07:31.040 --> 07:31.830
Really?

07:33.240 --> 07:34.830
Your flower ornament is beautiful.

07:35.120 --> 07:36.360
Did you make it yourself?

07:38.000 --> 07:40.510
I heard he's a high-ranking official
in the Northern Capital

07:40.750 --> 07:43.120
who can speak directly to His Majesty.

07:44.000 --> 07:48.160
He's far more powerful
than your brother.

07:56.070 --> 07:56.920
Lin Xiuwan.

07:57.600 --> 08:00.390
You're currently looking for a match.

08:00.830 --> 08:02.390
If you get into a fight today,

08:02.600 --> 08:04.000
you'll ruin your reputation.

08:04.480 --> 08:05.870
No one will dare marry you.

08:07.480 --> 08:08.680
I'm not looking for a match,

08:08.680 --> 08:09.750
so I can fight.

08:09.870 --> 08:10.240
You...

08:23.390 --> 08:25.680
I just wanted to offer you
some dried persimmon

08:26.390 --> 08:28.190
to sweeten that mouth of yours.

08:29.040 --> 08:29.830
You...

08:35.150 --> 08:36.390
As if I want it.

08:36.910 --> 08:37.360
Let's go.

08:43.630 --> 08:44.630
You're useless.

08:45.440 --> 08:47.000
She insulted Jinqi right to your face,

08:47.150 --> 08:48.510
and you didn't even dare talk back.

08:49.320 --> 08:50.600
I'm useless.

08:51.000 --> 08:52.080
It's all my fault.

08:55.550 --> 08:56.510
Xiuwan,

08:57.320 --> 08:59.270
don't be so hard on Xiuru.

08:59.510 --> 09:00.870
Xiuru is timid.

09:01.000 --> 09:02.120
She's easily frightened.

09:03.320 --> 09:04.150
Second Young Lady.

09:05.510 --> 09:07.460
(Yinxian, Xiuwan's second-class maid)
Old Madam has a message for you.

09:19.960 --> 09:21.270
What did she say about Jinqi?

09:24.320 --> 09:26.240
Nanny Zhou found out everything.

09:26.440 --> 09:27.840
Second Young Master Xie is wearing

09:27.840 --> 09:29.270
a dark teal robe today

09:29.510 --> 09:31.030
with a plum blossom ornament.

09:31.960 --> 09:34.750
- Good.
- Good.

09:39.240 --> 09:41.000
- Good.
- Good.

10:09.150 --> 10:10.790
- Good.
- Good.

10:35.510 --> 10:37.510
I didn't expect Young Master Xie

10:37.510 --> 10:39.032
to be skilled not only in his studies,

10:39.200 --> 10:40.390
but in archery as well.

10:42.728 --> 10:44.440
What nonsense are you talking about?

10:44.536 --> 10:46.180
Watch yourself,
or I'll tell First Madam

10:46.360 --> 10:47.270
and have you slapped.

10:48.360 --> 10:50.000
I misspoke.

10:50.248 --> 10:52.000
For now, he's
still Second Young Master Xie.

10:52.390 --> 10:53.600
Only after the wedding

10:54.000 --> 10:55.390
will he be your husband.

11:00.776 --> 11:02.632
I understand everything you've told me.

11:02.870 --> 11:03.630
You may go.

11:03.910 --> 11:04.600
Yes.

11:17.480 --> 11:19.510
What did Old Madam tell you

11:19.870 --> 11:21.270
to make you so happy?

11:25.840 --> 11:26.630
I'd say

11:26.630 --> 11:28.870
it wasn't something Old Madam said,

11:29.840 --> 11:32.870
but one of the men in this garden...

11:34.360 --> 11:34.790
Well...

11:34.790 --> 11:35.200
You...

11:39.336 --> 11:40.744
It's my fault for being careless.

11:40.790 --> 11:41.150
But...

11:41.510 --> 11:43.030
I was just about to win.

11:43.140 --> 11:44.270
(Xie Feng)

11:44.270 --> 11:46.600
(Xie Zhao's younger sister)
We were clearly evenly matched.

11:46.616 --> 11:47.832
There was no winner or loser.

11:49.480 --> 11:50.720
You all saw it.

11:50.960 --> 11:52.320
Hurry and settle this for me.

11:52.870 --> 11:54.630
No one can recreate
the game from memory,

11:54.750 --> 11:56.270
so naturally, each side

11:56.270 --> 11:57.600
has its own story.

12:06.200 --> 12:07.080
You...

12:07.360 --> 12:09.192
If you don't know what to say, say less.

12:34.120 --> 12:36.600
- Good.
- Good.

12:46.670 --> 12:48.360
- Good.
- Good.

12:48.720 --> 12:49.510
Impressive!

12:49.510 --> 12:51.064
(Lin Jinqiao, Madam Wang's son,
Third Young Master of the Lin family)

12:53.750 --> 12:54.390
Jinqi.

12:54.550 --> 12:56.320
Zheng is incredible.

12:58.630 --> 12:59.390
Zheng,

12:59.390 --> 13:00.510
that was really impressive.

13:00.510 --> 13:01.870
Let's go hunting together sometime.

13:02.080 --> 13:02.600
Sure.

13:04.152 --> 13:06.910
Jinqi, you'd better be ready
to drink until you drop this time.

13:08.390 --> 13:10.000
Don't forget what we're here for today.

13:10.870 --> 13:12.200
Xiuwan's marriage.

13:15.336 --> 13:16.390
You mean the Xie family?

13:20.000 --> 13:20.670
Don't worry.

13:20.670 --> 13:21.510
There's still time.

13:23.880 --> 13:24.670
- Good.
- Good.

13:24.670 --> 13:25.270
Impressive!

13:25.270 --> 13:26.632
Another point for the blue team.

13:26.960 --> 13:27.960
Excellent shot!

13:32.940 --> 13:36.860
(Xie Zhao, courtesy name Xianzhang)

13:37.550 --> 13:41.750
The Lin family can barely
be considered a scholarly family.

13:43.720 --> 13:46.790
How is it that the younger generation
is so uncultivated,

13:47.270 --> 13:49.510
without a trace of literary refinement?

13:49.670 --> 13:50.870
- Good.
- Good.

13:51.750 --> 13:52.670
No wonder.

14:02.968 --> 14:05.660
(Lin Jinlan, son of Lin Changzheng's
concubine, Second Young Master)

14:05.670 --> 14:07.080
You have quite a discerning eye.

14:07.480 --> 14:09.910
May I ask which family you're from?

14:10.910 --> 14:11.870
I'm Xie Zhao,

14:11.960 --> 14:13.128
courtesy name Xianzhang,

14:13.790 --> 14:15.670
of the Xie family
of Meizigang, Yuhuatai.

14:17.510 --> 14:19.000
So you're a descendant of Lord Xie.

14:19.670 --> 14:22.600
The histories describe
Lord Xie as refined and perceptive,

14:22.744 --> 14:24.408
with an elegant
and distinguished bearing.

14:24.790 --> 14:25.840
Seeing you today,

14:27.128 --> 14:29.544
I find the words of
the ancients were indeed true.

14:30.670 --> 14:31.870
May I ask your name?

14:32.240 --> 14:33.270
I'm Lin Jinlan,

14:33.510 --> 14:34.320
courtesy name Suiyun,

14:34.790 --> 14:35.870
from the Lin family,

14:36.248 --> 14:38.350
which can barely
be considered a scholarly family.

14:38.360 --> 14:39.240
Good.

14:43.992 --> 14:45.624
Jinlan, when did you get here?

14:46.510 --> 14:49.390
It seems you and Xianzhang
have already met.

14:49.480 --> 14:50.824
No need for me to introduce you.

14:54.390 --> 14:55.440
I heard all the excitement,

14:56.030 --> 14:57.080
so I came to join in.

15:00.150 --> 15:02.720
Which team are you on, Xianzhang?

15:04.504 --> 15:05.740
I stepped away
to relieve myself earlier.

15:05.750 --> 15:08.104
I accidentally got my clothes wet
while washing my hands,

15:08.110 --> 15:09.064
so I changed.

15:09.440 --> 15:10.600
Then I forgot my ribbon.

15:10.870 --> 15:11.670
Second Young Master.

15:13.910 --> 15:14.840
You forgot this.

15:16.600 --> 15:17.200
Go on.

15:19.670 --> 15:20.790
I'm on the red team,

15:21.480 --> 15:22.670
with Fengtai.

15:24.080 --> 15:26.360
Neither Xianzhang nor I
care much for archery.

15:26.390 --> 15:27.640
It's rather dull to just watch.

15:27.790 --> 15:30.080
Why don't we
make friends through poetry,

15:30.440 --> 15:31.736
with drinking games and liquor?

15:32.030 --> 15:32.670
Sounds good.

15:34.120 --> 15:35.510
Suiyun, do you know

15:35.510 --> 15:37.320
any witty drinking games
involving poetry?

15:39.320 --> 15:42.390
Use lines from the Four Books and Five
Classics to match names of medicines.

15:44.870 --> 15:45.670
That's a good one.

15:46.200 --> 15:48.910
You'd have to know the Four Books
and Five Classics by heart

15:49.000 --> 15:50.320
and be well-versed in medicine

15:50.440 --> 15:51.750
to play this drinking game.

15:52.120 --> 15:53.790
Refined and entertaining.

15:54.600 --> 15:55.720
Just to my liking.

15:56.712 --> 15:58.120
I've been frail since childhood.

15:58.472 --> 15:59.720
Before I even learned to eat,

15:59.790 --> 16:01.304
I'd already learned to take medicine.

16:02.120 --> 16:03.920
I wouldn't say my illnesses
made me a doctor,

16:04.030 --> 16:05.496
but I've read a few medical books.

16:05.560 --> 16:06.960
That gives me a slight advantage.

16:07.320 --> 16:08.120
Not at all.

16:08.750 --> 16:09.910
We Xie children

16:10.360 --> 16:12.750
are expected to read widely
from an early age.

16:12.888 --> 16:14.600
We've read plenty
of medical classics, too.

16:14.750 --> 16:15.670
So it's no advantage.

16:18.360 --> 16:18.790
Good.

16:19.870 --> 16:21.000
Then it's settled.

16:21.360 --> 16:22.750
We'll keep the red and blue teams.

16:22.808 --> 16:25.864
Match lines from the Four Books and
Five Classics with names of medicines.

16:55.900 --> 16:57.180
(The Story of the Lute)

16:57.224 --> 16:58.820
(Revised Edition
of The Story of the Lute, Volume One)

17:06.700 --> 17:12.740
(The Story of the Lute)

17:46.460 --> 17:48.060
(Larkspur)

17:49.310 --> 17:51.030
Larkspur...

17:56.400 --> 17:58.270
Take this back to the room.

18:00.270 --> 18:01.000
On the seventh,

18:01.110 --> 18:02.310
it'll be perfect to wear.

18:02.830 --> 18:03.550
All right.

18:03.620 --> 18:05.540
(Travels in the Western Regions)

18:05.550 --> 18:08.240
(Xiaolian mentions
Young Lady Du's given name,)

18:08.856 --> 18:10.872
(Cuique.)
[*"Cuique" also refers to larkspur in Chinese]

18:11.128 --> 18:13.304
(Young Master wore
a larkspur flower ornament.)

18:13.704 --> 18:15.224
(Travels in the Western Regions)

18:26.310 --> 18:27.790
(I want to start over)

18:28.168 --> 18:29.680
(and live a better life than before.)

18:31.400 --> 18:32.440
(I hope)

18:33.510 --> 18:35.070
(you can live better lives, too.)

18:50.180 --> 18:52.940
(Travels in the Western Regions)

19:03.550 --> 19:04.240
Gantang.

19:05.310 --> 19:07.160
Where are you going in such a hurry?

19:07.310 --> 19:09.110
I'm taking something to Yuchan.

19:09.540 --> 19:11.160
All the masters are in the garden today.

19:11.170 --> 19:12.990
I thought I'd enjoy
the rare peace and quiet,

19:13.000 --> 19:14.240
and I got a few crabapples,

19:14.424 --> 19:16.680
so I was going to Luxue Lodge
to chat with Xiaolian.

19:16.790 --> 19:17.830
But guess what?

19:18.310 --> 19:19.960
All the garden gates were locked.

19:20.160 --> 19:21.400
I went round and round

19:21.550 --> 19:22.888
until I reached Chenxiang Pavilion

19:22.960 --> 19:24.350
and finally found an entrance.

19:24.550 --> 19:26.110
But there were two fierce old servants

19:26.110 --> 19:27.960
guarding it and refusing
to let anyone through.

19:28.590 --> 19:30.440
Yuchan is still at the banquet.

19:30.520 --> 19:32.040
Even if you go, they won't let you in.

19:32.160 --> 19:33.592
There's no point making the trip.

19:33.720 --> 19:34.960
But I have something important

19:34.960 --> 19:36.000
to give Yuchan.

19:36.200 --> 19:37.830
Can't those servants make an exception?

19:38.296 --> 19:40.136
Those two servants
looked downright fierce

19:40.248 --> 19:42.400
and wouldn't
make an exception for anyone.

19:42.440 --> 19:44.568
(Plowing the Clouds, Sowing the Moon)
I'd never seen them before.

19:44.750 --> 19:47.440
I don't know what backwater
they found these stubborn women in.

19:50.750 --> 19:51.960
I don't have to go in.

19:51.960 --> 19:54.110
Could you please send someone
to call Yuchan for me?

19:54.184 --> 19:56.216
I really have
something important to give her.

19:56.640 --> 19:57.350
Yuchan

19:57.350 --> 19:58.790
is the head maid of Zhichun Hall.

19:58.960 --> 19:59.790
Even First Madam

19:59.920 --> 20:01.304
listens to what she has to say.

20:06.550 --> 20:09.030
Please have some of these crabapples.

20:10.110 --> 20:11.270
They're a small gift for you.

20:11.550 --> 20:12.160
Go.

20:13.070 --> 20:14.160
Yuchan, Jinchan,

20:14.160 --> 20:14.990
whatever her name is.

20:15.070 --> 20:16.830
I only know
First Madam gave strict orders

20:17.000 --> 20:18.920
that none of you may pass through here.

20:21.240 --> 20:23.480
Calling each other sisters
sounds very nice,

20:23.640 --> 20:25.848
but I bet you're really
after the young masters inside.

20:25.880 --> 20:28.160
You think a pretty face
will help you climb the ladder?

20:28.420 --> 20:28.940
Bah!

20:29.310 --> 20:30.070
Shameless hussy.

20:30.070 --> 20:30.720
Wretched girl.

20:30.920 --> 20:31.510
How can you

20:31.510 --> 20:32.640
say such awful things?

20:32.920 --> 20:33.350
Go.

20:33.550 --> 20:35.000
- Go. Go.
- Hurry up.

20:35.000 --> 20:35.440
Lanxiang.

20:35.440 --> 20:35.960
Go!

20:37.350 --> 20:37.960
Go!

20:38.200 --> 20:38.640
Go!

20:39.110 --> 20:39.510
Go!

20:40.240 --> 20:40.830
Go!

20:49.110 --> 20:49.920
Lanxiang.

20:50.920 --> 20:52.480
Is this urgent?

20:52.550 --> 20:54.030
Can't it wait until after the banquet?

20:55.750 --> 20:56.750
After the banquet,

20:56.880 --> 20:58.240
everything will already be settled

20:58.750 --> 20:59.960
and there'll be an outcome.

21:02.070 --> 21:03.830
There's no other way right now.

21:04.160 --> 21:06.000
Those two servants won't budge.

21:06.200 --> 21:07.310
They won't even take money.

21:07.830 --> 21:09.920
It seems First Madam
gave them strict orders

21:10.400 --> 21:11.550
not to let anyone in or out.

21:23.400 --> 21:24.200
What's wrong?

21:37.000 --> 21:38.270
We can't get in,

21:39.030 --> 21:40.310
but someone else can.

21:43.720 --> 21:45.240
Is this your pellet?

21:56.140 --> 21:57.860
(Lin Jincen, Madam Wang's son,
Fourth Young Master of the Lin family)

21:57.880 --> 21:58.750
Who are you?

21:58.920 --> 22:00.590
How did you know I was hiding here?

22:03.680 --> 22:04.350
Come on, hurry!

22:04.350 --> 22:05.440
If you lose, you drink.

22:05.440 --> 22:06.460
Come on, everyone, drink.

22:06.880 --> 22:07.880
Give us another one.

22:08.640 --> 22:09.790
Another one.

22:09.992 --> 22:11.460
- You go first.
- That's not enough.

22:11.550 --> 22:12.960
After three nights, he left Zhou.

22:13.510 --> 22:14.450
Wang Bu Liu Xing.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "the king does not make one stay."]

22:14.460 --> 22:15.550
Well said. Wang Bu Liu Xing.

22:15.550 --> 22:16.260
- Good.
- Good.

22:16.640 --> 22:17.350
Drink.

22:17.510 --> 22:20.480
- Drink.
- Drink.

22:20.952 --> 22:23.030
The young men of my circle
are bold and unrestrained.

22:23.112 --> 22:24.300
Dang Gui.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "ought to return."]

22:24.310 --> 22:25.270
- Good.
- Good.

22:25.270 --> 22:27.830
- Drink.
- Drink.

22:30.424 --> 22:32.400
Between the seventh
and eighth months, drought sets in.

22:32.424 --> 22:33.820
Ban Xia.
[*A medicinal herb means "half summer."]

22:33.830 --> 22:34.640
- Good.
- Good.

22:34.720 --> 22:35.350
- Good.
- Good.

22:37.110 --> 22:38.920
- Drink.
- Drink.

22:38.960 --> 22:39.550
Drink.

22:39.640 --> 22:40.310
Drink.

22:42.240 --> 22:43.440
Guan Zhong did not die.

22:43.450 --> 22:44.260
Du Huo.
[*A medicinal herb means "to live alone."]

22:44.270 --> 22:45.000
- Good.
- Good.

22:45.510 --> 22:46.510
Well done, Jinlan.

22:46.510 --> 22:47.270
Drink.

22:51.830 --> 22:54.880
When the state has lost its way,
one may withdraw and hide.

22:54.936 --> 22:56.990
Chan Tui.
[*A medicinal herb means "cicada slough."]

22:57.400 --> 22:58.200
- Good.
- Good.

22:59.272 --> 23:00.200
- Come on.
- Drink.

23:00.640 --> 23:01.920
Zheng, give us another one.

23:02.270 --> 23:02.920
Let me think.

23:04.510 --> 23:05.270
Another one.

23:05.270 --> 23:05.920
Think.

23:08.056 --> 23:09.304
One studies from an early age.

23:09.368 --> 23:11.592
Yuan Zhi.
[*A medicinal herb means "lofty aspiration."]

23:11.640 --> 23:13.160
- Good.
- Good.

23:13.440 --> 23:14.240
Well said. Yuan Zhi.

23:14.590 --> 23:15.270
Drink.

23:15.480 --> 23:16.920
A child still in his tender years.

23:16.980 --> 23:19.140
Ru Xiang.
[*A medicinal herb means "milk fragrance."]

23:19.192 --> 23:21.710
Zeng Xi died. Ku Shen.
[*A medicinal herb means "bitter ginseng."]

23:21.720 --> 23:22.920
With righteousness in one's heart.

23:22.920 --> 23:23.590
Jue Ming Zi.
[*A medicinal herb means "clear discernment."]

23:23.680 --> 23:24.440
Good.

23:24.510 --> 23:26.630
Jieyu, the Madman of Chu,
passed by Confucius' carriage singing.

23:26.640 --> 23:27.400
Che Qian Zi.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "seed before the carriage."]

23:27.480 --> 23:28.350
Suffering from a cold ailment.

23:28.360 --> 23:29.440
Fang Feng.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "guard against wind."]

23:29.590 --> 23:30.480
- Good!
- Good!

23:32.504 --> 23:34.030
A petty man's virtue bends like grass.

23:34.120 --> 23:35.224
Sui Feng Zi.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "one who follows the wind."]

23:35.304 --> 23:36.030
Good one!

23:36.232 --> 23:37.960
Wherever boats and carts can reach.

23:38.008 --> 23:38.950
Mu Tong.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "wood passage."]

23:38.960 --> 23:39.750
- Good!
- Good!

23:39.750 --> 23:40.680
Good one!

23:40.680 --> 23:41.590
- Good one.
- Drink!

23:41.976 --> 23:44.456
Remaining in his place
while all the stars gather around him.

23:44.510 --> 23:45.440
Tian Nan Xing.
[*A medicinal herb means "southern star."]

23:45.450 --> 23:46.990
The peach tree blooms
in all its splendor.

23:47.000 --> 23:47.790
Hong Hua.
[*A medicinal herb means "red flower."]

23:47.816 --> 23:49.070
- Restore fallen states.
- Good!

23:49.070 --> 23:50.340
Continue lines that have died out.

23:50.350 --> 23:51.160
Xu Duan.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "restore what is broken."]

23:51.270 --> 23:52.590
Like breaching the banks
of the Yangtze and Yellow Rivers.

23:52.600 --> 23:53.550
Ze Xie.
[*A medicinal herb meaning "marsh drainage."]

23:53.550 --> 23:54.270
- Good!
- Good!

23:54.328 --> 23:55.496
Dyed black,
yet never stained.

23:55.500 --> 23:56.550
Ren Zhong Bai.
[*A medicinal substance.]

23:56.750 --> 23:57.790
- Good!
- Good!

23:58.920 --> 24:00.070
You can't think of anything?

24:01.200 --> 24:02.350
You're going to lose.

24:02.590 --> 24:03.590
Come on.

24:04.160 --> 24:04.960
All right.

24:05.440 --> 24:07.160
Settle your drinking debt first.

24:07.256 --> 24:08.310
Drink everything you owe.

24:08.510 --> 24:09.270
That's right.

24:12.310 --> 24:13.070
Drink up.

24:13.070 --> 24:13.830
Come on, drink.

24:16.080 --> 24:16.840
Yes, yes. Come on.

24:16.960 --> 24:17.640
Fengtai.

24:17.830 --> 24:18.400
Xianzhang.

24:23.510 --> 24:24.160
Wait.

24:24.790 --> 24:25.590
I've got one.

24:27.288 --> 24:28.550
It's on the tip of my tongue.

24:30.920 --> 24:31.720
Say it, then.

24:32.350 --> 24:33.480
Cangwu Feicui.

24:33.912 --> 24:36.008
Cuique.
[*A medicinal herb's name, larkspur.]

24:36.480 --> 24:37.790
Cuique?

24:37.920 --> 24:39.960
Cuique...

24:39.960 --> 24:41.480
Cangwu Feicui

24:41.480 --> 24:42.480
is mentioned

24:43.160 --> 24:44.070
in the Book of Zhou.

24:44.160 --> 24:45.920
The Shuowen Jiezi describes

24:46.200 --> 24:47.000
"fei"

24:47.480 --> 24:48.590
as a red-feathered bird,

24:49.030 --> 24:49.640
and "cui"

24:49.816 --> 24:51.030
as a green-feathered bird.

24:51.510 --> 24:53.790
Together, "feicui" refers to Cuique.

24:54.720 --> 24:56.750
What kind of medicine is larkspur?

24:56.750 --> 24:58.030
I've never heard of it.

24:58.200 --> 25:00.070
Larkspur tastes bitter

25:00.120 --> 25:01.928
and is warm in nature.
It is highly toxic.

25:02.000 --> 25:03.890
Its tuberous roots can
be used medicinally after processing.

25:03.900 --> 25:06.260
It clears heat and toxins,
reduces swelling and relieves pain.

25:06.270 --> 25:07.480
It is a foreign medicinal herb,

25:08.070 --> 25:09.200
rarely seen in Jiangnan.

25:09.310 --> 25:11.030
I only happened to come across it

25:11.096 --> 25:12.580
in a book from my family's collection.

25:13.030 --> 25:15.720
If Fengtai hadn't happened
to be wearing one today,

25:15.880 --> 25:18.640
I wouldn't have
thought of it so quickly.

25:19.070 --> 25:19.880
Gentlemen,

25:19.960 --> 25:21.272
thank you for letting me win.

25:23.240 --> 25:24.270
Cuique...

25:24.472 --> 25:26.110
Isn't that Young Lady Du's given name?

25:26.110 --> 25:26.590
Jinqiao,

25:29.030 --> 25:30.400
isn't Young Lady Du

25:30.400 --> 25:32.000
staying at the Lin Residence now?

25:32.440 --> 25:34.670
You certainly have
the advantage of being close to her.

25:34.680 --> 25:36.000
It seems a happy occasion is near.

25:36.792 --> 25:37.680
Isn't that right?

25:37.880 --> 25:40.270
No wonder the magpies have been calling

25:40.270 --> 25:41.480
in pairs all day.

25:41.480 --> 25:42.030
Exactly.

25:42.030 --> 25:43.160
Fengtai should certainly

25:43.160 --> 25:44.080
drink a toast with us.

25:44.100 --> 25:46.160
I heard Congyi
once took a blade for Fengtai.

25:46.310 --> 25:48.160
So Fengtai is going to repay

25:48.160 --> 25:49.920
that life-saving favor with himself?

25:50.030 --> 25:50.830
Right?

25:51.110 --> 25:51.640
Have a drink.

25:51.640 --> 25:52.440
Right?

25:52.510 --> 25:53.030
Come on.

25:55.720 --> 25:56.480
Have a drink.

25:56.480 --> 25:57.350
Come on. Have a drink.

25:57.350 --> 25:58.640
You've got to drink to that.

25:59.070 --> 25:59.880
Right?

25:59.880 --> 26:00.310
Come on.

26:00.310 --> 26:01.240
Have a drink.

26:01.240 --> 26:01.550
Come on.

26:01.550 --> 26:01.920
Have one.

26:01.930 --> 26:02.310
Have one.

26:02.310 --> 26:03.270
Come on.

26:03.480 --> 26:03.920
Come on.

26:03.920 --> 26:06.550
- Have one.
- Have one.

26:06.750 --> 26:07.480
Come on, have one.

26:08.440 --> 26:10.960
- Have a drink.
- Have a drink.

26:10.960 --> 26:11.490
Have a drink.

26:29.830 --> 26:30.640
Today...

26:31.640 --> 26:33.510
Old Master is here.

27:07.350 --> 27:08.000
Gentlemen,

27:08.648 --> 27:09.704
to tell you the truth,

27:10.168 --> 27:11.752
I really didn't know what kind of flower

27:11.768 --> 27:12.830
I was wearing today.

27:13.640 --> 27:15.270
Since it was a flower from Grandfather,

27:16.160 --> 27:17.480
of course, I had to wear it.

27:25.510 --> 27:26.200
Grandfather.

27:32.720 --> 27:34.480
You know nothing about farming,

27:34.920 --> 27:38.480
so you don't appreciate
the value of this flower.

27:39.680 --> 27:42.200
The entire larkspur plant is poisonous.

27:42.760 --> 27:44.440
Once dried and ground into powder,

27:44.450 --> 27:46.610
it can be mixed with water
and sprayed over the fields

27:46.680 --> 27:48.510
to kill insects that damage the crops

27:48.680 --> 27:50.160
and help ensure a good harvest.

27:50.480 --> 27:52.510
As expected of the Xie family.

27:52.790 --> 27:54.240
You are widely read

27:54.510 --> 27:56.310
and full of learning.

27:57.270 --> 27:57.920
All right.

27:59.270 --> 28:00.070
These flowers...

28:00.680 --> 28:03.270
Each of you take one.

28:12.550 --> 28:13.030
Take one.

28:13.240 --> 28:16.640
Always remember
that food is vital to the people,

28:17.510 --> 28:19.830
and agriculture
is the foundation of the nation.

28:21.144 --> 28:24.808
- Thank you for your guidance, Grandfather.
- Thank you for your guidance, Old Master.

28:49.830 --> 28:50.920
This flower is beautiful.

28:57.480 --> 28:58.640
We'll take our leave now.

29:17.750 --> 29:18.350
Cuique.

29:18.440 --> 29:19.030
It's your turn.

29:29.960 --> 29:31.960
Don't knock over
the pieces again this time.

29:33.030 --> 29:34.750
I was just about to win.

29:39.550 --> 29:40.160
Xiuru.

30:02.720 --> 30:03.440
Young Lady Du.

30:03.640 --> 30:05.000
First Madam wants to see you.

30:29.500 --> 30:32.300
(Resounding Call)

30:35.510 --> 30:36.110
First Madam.

30:39.350 --> 30:39.830
Come.

30:43.848 --> 30:45.030
Sit down and we'll talk.

30:53.550 --> 30:54.590
Cuique.

30:56.880 --> 30:59.070
What does your name mean?

31:02.680 --> 31:05.830
Everyone thinks
I'm named after a kind of bird.

31:07.030 --> 31:08.070
But I'm not.

31:08.640 --> 31:10.160
Like the morning glory,

31:10.720 --> 31:12.160
it's a kind of blue flower.

31:20.030 --> 31:21.200
Is this it?

31:23.480 --> 31:25.880
This is a larkspur
flower ornament I made.

31:26.240 --> 31:27.680
Since it matches my name,

31:28.000 --> 31:29.440
I made a few extra

31:29.480 --> 31:31.110
to wear from time to time.

31:31.310 --> 31:33.510
How did this get here?

31:36.510 --> 31:38.400
Did you give Jinqi

31:39.070 --> 31:40.200
a larkspur flower ornament?

31:43.680 --> 31:44.480
First Madam.

31:44.808 --> 31:47.110
Though I come from a military
household and grew up poor,

31:47.176 --> 31:49.368
I was taught to read
and know right from wrong.

31:50.270 --> 31:52.110
How could I do something so improper?

31:56.590 --> 31:57.480
Good child.

31:58.000 --> 31:58.830
Don't worry.

31:59.400 --> 32:01.920
Whatever the misunderstanding is,
we can clear it up.

32:06.240 --> 32:08.070
Among the festive ornaments
you gave Jinqi,

32:08.640 --> 32:10.480
there was a larkspur flower ornament.

32:11.640 --> 32:14.000
Think carefully about how that happened.

32:20.200 --> 32:21.000
That day,

32:23.000 --> 32:24.790
because I had gifts for so many people,

32:26.160 --> 32:27.920
I was busy making the festive ornaments

32:28.480 --> 32:29.920
while asking Xiaolian

32:30.350 --> 32:33.030
to put them into the box.

32:34.310 --> 32:37.110
Later, Xiaolian was also
the one carrying the box

32:37.192 --> 32:39.080
when she accompanied me to Zhichun Hall.

32:39.400 --> 32:40.200
Xiaolian.

32:40.480 --> 32:41.400
There's no rush.

32:41.480 --> 32:42.310
Pack them carefully.

32:43.070 --> 32:44.590
We were extremely busy that day.

32:44.720 --> 32:47.510
From beginning to end,
I never touched the box.

32:48.270 --> 32:49.350
Thinking about it now,

32:50.070 --> 32:52.920
Xiaolian must have
made a mistake in the confusion.

32:53.480 --> 32:56.590
I thought they were only
inexpensive festive ornaments,

32:59.640 --> 33:01.110
so I didn't think to check them.

33:01.110 --> 33:02.240
It's all my fault.

33:02.510 --> 33:04.160
I was too careless.

33:10.680 --> 33:11.550
Good child.

33:12.424 --> 33:14.936
As long as we've
cleared things up, that's enough.

33:16.510 --> 33:17.000
Come.

33:20.030 --> 33:22.240
Nothing happened in the end,

33:22.790 --> 33:24.240
so don't take it to heart.

33:27.400 --> 33:28.270
Everything's fine now.

33:29.790 --> 33:30.400
All right.

33:33.720 --> 33:35.400
Then how did
this larkspur flower ornament

33:35.880 --> 33:37.920
get from Young Lady Du's room

33:38.680 --> 33:40.350
onto Young Master's head?

33:42.480 --> 33:43.070
Lanxiang.

33:43.070 --> 33:43.920
Stay right there.

33:46.536 --> 33:48.030
If Lanxiang hadn't been quick-witted

33:48.184 --> 33:49.880
and Old Master hadn't arrived in time,

33:50.440 --> 33:52.640
I'd be making arrangements

33:52.640 --> 33:54.216
for Young Master to take a concubine,

33:54.310 --> 33:55.830
while everyone in Jinling City

33:56.000 --> 33:56.830
pointed fingers at us

33:56.830 --> 33:59.480
and accused the Lin family
of having no proper standards.

33:59.864 --> 34:01.920
We claim we're repaying
a debt of gratitude,

34:02.240 --> 34:03.920
yet we'd have lured an orphaned,

34:03.992 --> 34:05.608
respectable young lady into our home

34:05.672 --> 34:08.070
and made her a concubine
without a proper matchmaker!

34:08.590 --> 34:10.070
Young Master meant well.

34:10.104 --> 34:12.290
He was afraid Young Lady Du
might take it the wrong way

34:12.440 --> 34:13.960
and think we found her gift too modest,

34:14.232 --> 34:16.840
so he made a point of wearing
the flower ornament she gave him.

34:17.528 --> 34:19.272
It was all my fault for being careless

34:19.288 --> 34:21.150
and not finding out
what kind of flower it was.

34:21.360 --> 34:22.744
Please punish me, First Madam.

34:23.400 --> 34:24.630
Please punish me.

34:26.800 --> 34:27.590
Xiaolian!

34:31.510 --> 34:34.710
Young Lady Du was busy
making festive ornaments that day.

34:35.400 --> 34:36.880
I was the one who packed the box.

34:38.280 --> 34:41.190
Young Lady Du never told me
to put in a larkspur flower ornament,

34:42.230 --> 34:43.510
and I didn't put one in, either.

34:43.800 --> 34:44.280
I...

34:44.550 --> 34:46.630
I don't know how it ended up in the box.

34:47.510 --> 34:49.360
I must have put it in by mistake.

34:51.550 --> 34:52.360
First Madam.

34:52.960 --> 34:54.000
I made a mistake.

34:54.070 --> 34:55.400
Please give me a good beating.

34:56.510 --> 34:57.110
No.

34:57.630 --> 35:00.840
My mother says beatings
never teach me a lesson.

35:01.320 --> 35:02.710
Beating me won't work.

35:03.760 --> 35:06.590
First Madam, don't give me any food.

35:06.800 --> 35:08.110
Starve me until I can't bear it.

35:08.670 --> 35:09.800
Three days without food.

35:10.150 --> 35:10.630
No.

35:10.840 --> 35:12.030
Five days without food.

35:12.400 --> 35:13.760
Once I'm nearly starving,

35:13.880 --> 35:15.150
I'll definitely remember.

35:15.256 --> 35:16.936
I'll never make the same mistake again.

35:16.940 --> 35:17.590
That's enough.

35:18.710 --> 35:19.920
Speak properly.

35:21.150 --> 35:23.840
Did you know this was
a larkspur flower ornament?

35:25.840 --> 35:26.840
No.

35:27.480 --> 35:29.190
When I saw Young Lady Du making it,

35:29.272 --> 35:31.110
I even asked her
about it out of curiosity.

35:31.880 --> 35:32.960
Young Lady Du

35:34.550 --> 35:36.030
just smiled.

35:36.550 --> 35:38.510
It wasn't until Lanxiang and Nanny Wu

35:38.510 --> 35:40.060
came to Luxue Lodge looking for me today

35:40.070 --> 35:42.110
that I learned it was
a larkspur flower ornament.

35:46.030 --> 35:46.670
Nanny Han.

35:46.800 --> 35:47.360
Yuchan.

35:47.360 --> 35:48.150
Xiaolian.

35:48.480 --> 35:49.800
Forfeit six months' wages.

35:50.480 --> 35:52.960
Nanny Han and Yuchan,
twenty strikes with the ruler.

35:53.230 --> 35:54.030
Xiaolian,

35:55.880 --> 35:57.070
twenty strikes with the ruler

35:57.280 --> 35:58.510
and no food for three days.

36:00.190 --> 36:00.840
- Yes.
- Yes.

36:29.230 --> 36:30.000
Lanxiang.

36:34.480 --> 36:35.550
This is your reward.

36:50.000 --> 36:50.590
First Madam.

36:50.710 --> 36:51.190
This...

36:51.480 --> 36:52.480
Keep it safe.

36:53.230 --> 36:56.190
Tell everyone I rewarded you
with ten taels of silver,

36:56.630 --> 36:58.070
so no one gets jealous.

36:58.510 --> 37:01.590
From now on, just as you did today,

37:02.030 --> 37:04.840
continue to do your best in everything.

37:06.568 --> 37:08.232
Thank you for the reward, First Madam.

37:09.360 --> 37:10.710
Could I take just one gold ingot

37:11.360 --> 37:13.920
and ask you to give Nanny Han
and the others fewer strikes?

37:18.190 --> 37:19.000
No.

37:20.670 --> 37:21.840
But after they're punished,

37:22.000 --> 37:24.070
Nanny Wu will bring them
the finest medicine.

37:30.000 --> 37:30.800
Today,

37:31.550 --> 37:33.030
Gantang was with me.

37:33.760 --> 37:34.960
Will she be rewarded, too?

37:37.510 --> 37:38.230
Yes.

37:40.150 --> 37:41.280
Is there anything else?

37:44.840 --> 37:45.590
Go back.

37:45.640 --> 37:47.672
The Young Master
still has some questions for you.

37:49.190 --> 37:49.760
Yes.

37:59.840 --> 38:01.440
Zheng gave me a slingshot.

38:01.800 --> 38:04.800
I ran into Lanxiang
while I was shooting birds with it.

38:06.320 --> 38:07.320
Who are you?

38:07.480 --> 38:09.150
How did you know I was hiding here?

38:10.360 --> 38:11.760
I saw a bird suddenly fly off,

38:11.840 --> 38:13.230
and then noticed your pellet.

38:13.304 --> 38:14.280
With a little attention,

38:14.280 --> 38:16.216
it wasn't hard
to guess where you were hiding.

38:25.128 --> 38:26.070
Fourth Young Master.

38:26.984 --> 38:28.376
Do you know how to use one?

38:31.510 --> 38:32.320
No.

38:33.590 --> 38:34.480
That's no fun.

38:35.840 --> 38:36.760
But I know someone

38:36.760 --> 38:38.456
who's very good at making slingshots.

38:38.872 --> 38:41.096
His slingshots
can hit a bird almost every time.

38:41.320 --> 38:42.030
Really?

38:42.568 --> 38:44.540
I wouldn't dare lie to you,
Fourth Young Master.

38:44.710 --> 38:46.030
Uncle Liu from my neighborhood

38:46.070 --> 38:47.280
is quite a craftsman

38:47.336 --> 38:48.730
and very good at making slingshots.

38:48.740 --> 38:50.420
The Lv family next door
has many children.

38:50.430 --> 38:51.530
To put meat on the table,

38:51.544 --> 38:53.624
they often go around
shooting birds with slingshots.

38:54.070 --> 38:55.480
Gray turtledoves,

38:55.670 --> 38:57.150
orange parrotbills,

38:57.440 --> 38:58.670
red-crested silver pheasants,

38:58.840 --> 39:00.320
greenish-brown green pigeons,

39:00.360 --> 39:02.648
white-bellied, yellow-necked
pheasant-tailed jacanas,

39:02.696 --> 39:04.150
crested hoopoes,

39:04.230 --> 39:05.670
and even the fairy among birds,

39:06.440 --> 39:08.320
the colorful fairy pitta.

39:08.590 --> 39:10.360
Its crown is fiery red,

39:10.360 --> 39:11.920
and its tail feathers are vivid green,

39:12.000 --> 39:13.480
this long,

39:13.480 --> 39:14.590
and absolutely beautiful.

39:14.880 --> 39:16.840
Can you really
shoot such beautiful birds?

39:17.368 --> 39:19.030
If you'd like one, Fourth Young Master,

39:19.280 --> 39:20.360
I'll ask Uncle Liu for help

39:20.360 --> 39:21.660
and have him make you a slingshot.

39:21.670 --> 39:22.830
You'll be able to shoot one.

39:22.840 --> 39:23.440
Good.

39:23.760 --> 39:24.800
Have him make one for me.

39:24.936 --> 39:25.840
How much will it cost?

39:26.670 --> 39:27.800
It's only a little trinket.

39:27.840 --> 39:29.840
Consider it a gift
from me, Fourth Young Master.

39:29.960 --> 39:32.550
I only ask that you do me a small favor.

39:33.070 --> 39:35.480
Lanxiang asked me
to take a book to Grandfather.

39:35.480 --> 39:38.280
I didn't think it was a big deal,
so I agreed.

39:38.824 --> 39:40.872
As soon as
Grandfather received the book,

39:41.320 --> 39:43.360
he sent Uncle Geng to fetch Lanxiang

39:43.400 --> 39:46.230
and asked to see
Nanny Wu from Aunt's household.

39:46.670 --> 39:49.230
Then Grandfather
told me to go play on my own.

39:55.440 --> 39:56.230
Jinqi.

39:57.590 --> 39:59.440
Once Lanxiang brings me the slingshot,

39:59.590 --> 40:01.320
I'll shoot a fairy pitta

40:01.550 --> 40:03.150
and use its prettiest tail feathers

40:03.280 --> 40:05.000
to make a flower ornament for you.

40:05.544 --> 40:08.070
It'll outshine the ornaments
worn by all the other young men.

40:11.230 --> 40:12.590
Next year on the Festival of Man,

40:13.070 --> 40:14.840
I'll wear the flower ornament
you give me.

40:15.320 --> 40:15.800
Good.

40:21.208 --> 40:22.110
Fourth Young Master.

40:22.440 --> 40:24.840
After you finish eating,
I'll take you riding.

40:25.320 --> 40:26.000
I'm full.

40:26.110 --> 40:26.480
Let's go.

40:26.670 --> 40:27.630
Let's go riding.

40:36.584 --> 40:38.616
Thank you
for the Seven Treasure Soup, Jinqi.

40:38.670 --> 40:40.880
Jiugao and I are going riding.

40:41.360 --> 40:41.960
Go ahead.

40:42.960 --> 40:43.630
I'm leaving.

40:45.590 --> 40:47.320
Jiugao, hurry up.

40:47.590 --> 40:48.840
I want to go riding.

41:19.400 --> 41:20.190
Young Master.

41:22.030 --> 41:25.070
Jincen said you'd give him a slingshot

41:25.480 --> 41:27.272
that could hit a bird with every shot.

41:29.360 --> 41:31.630
I was desperate and needed
Fourth Young Master's help,

41:31.880 --> 41:33.000
so I exaggerated.

41:33.070 --> 41:33.920
That was my fault.

41:34.110 --> 41:34.800
But

41:35.360 --> 41:37.710
Uncle Liu really does
make excellent slingshots.

41:37.832 --> 41:39.352
They're very good for shooting birds.

41:39.432 --> 41:41.500
As long as Fourth Young Master
practices diligently,

41:41.592 --> 41:43.160
he'll surely hit his mark every time.

41:44.840 --> 41:46.000
How did you know

41:46.150 --> 41:48.400
this book had information
about larkspur?

41:50.840 --> 41:52.960
Yuchan entrusted me
with a box of less important books

41:53.000 --> 41:54.310
and asked me to look after them,

41:54.400 --> 41:56.232
so I could learn
how to manage the study.

41:56.320 --> 41:58.840
The weather was good today,
so I took the books out to air.

41:59.190 --> 42:00.710
As Yuchan instructed,

42:01.030 --> 42:02.960
I had to carefully leaf
through every book

42:03.230 --> 42:05.030
to check for any damage

42:05.030 --> 42:05.760
or insect holes.

42:07.000 --> 42:08.280
When I was checking this book,

42:08.510 --> 42:10.000
the illustration looked familiar,

42:10.230 --> 42:11.480
so I took a closer look

42:12.030 --> 42:14.800
and realized it was the flower ornament
you were wearing today.

42:15.976 --> 42:17.830
(Larkspur)
Finding the illustration of larkspur

42:17.840 --> 42:18.550
was a coincidence.

42:19.840 --> 42:20.880
But with so little time,

42:21.016 --> 42:23.480
how did you know there were other
larkspur flower ornaments

42:23.480 --> 42:24.960
at Young Lady Du's Luxue Lodge?

42:26.360 --> 42:27.150
Old Master said that

42:27.208 --> 42:29.710
even he hadn't thought
of such a clever solution at the time

42:29.760 --> 42:30.880
to resolve the situation.

42:33.150 --> 42:34.400
Even if we now know

42:34.630 --> 42:36.360
that Cuique
is Young Lady Du's given name,

42:36.400 --> 42:37.550
it's already too late.

42:38.088 --> 42:40.280
Jinqi had already worn
the larkspur flower ornament

42:40.670 --> 42:42.480
in front of everyone.

42:43.064 --> 42:44.480
Young Master's marriage prospects

42:44.664 --> 42:46.280
have already suffered because of Zhao.

42:47.110 --> 42:49.800
If another scandal had broken out today,

42:50.232 --> 42:53.144
Young Master really wouldn't have
been able to find a good match.

42:55.630 --> 42:56.480
Old Master.

42:57.550 --> 42:59.630
What if Young Master wasn't the only one

42:59.630 --> 43:01.030
wearing a larkspur flower ornament?

43:05.020 --> 43:07.940
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:09.510 --> 43:11.110
The key to buying our freedom

43:11.110 --> 43:12.280
isn't money.

43:13.070 --> 43:14.510
It's First Madam's willingness.

43:16.030 --> 43:17.510
First Madam's willingness?

43:22.110 --> 43:24.030
We can't see it or touch it.

43:24.510 --> 43:25.550
It's not like money

43:25.800 --> 43:26.920
that we can go out and earn.

43:27.960 --> 43:29.150
We can't rush this.

43:29.576 --> 43:31.280
We must plan carefully before we act

43:31.710 --> 43:34.110
and wait for the right moment
to make our move.

43:35.000 --> 43:38.320
When that time comes, the three of us

43:38.320 --> 43:39.800
will surely be freed from servitude

43:40.110 --> 43:41.320
and become commoners.

43:56.701 --> 44:00.821
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:03.661 --> 44:08.181
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:09.461 --> 44:13.381
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:14.061 --> 44:16.821
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:17.541 --> 44:19.861
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:19.861 --> 44:22.941
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:24.461 --> 44:28.701
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:31.621 --> 44:35.781
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:37.581 --> 44:41.141
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:41.141 --> 44:44.701
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:45.501 --> 44:51.181
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:51.541 --> 44:55.861
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:56.221 --> 44:59.181
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:59.181 --> 45:02.941
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:02.941 --> 45:05.821
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:05.821 --> 45:09.901
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:09.901 --> 45:13.261
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:13.261 --> 45:17.021
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:17.021 --> 45:21.021
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:21.781 --> 45:25.941
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:25.941 --> 45:29.381
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:29.381 --> 45:33.021
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:33.021 --> 45:35.901
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:35.901 --> 45:39.981
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:39.981 --> 45:43.341
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:43.341 --> 45:46.981
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:46.981 --> 45:54.781
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
